                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Tri-Motors Safety Airways/83:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Armour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-07-29T14:00:00+01:00">July 29, 1929—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:48 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>363. Reference Department’s 227, July 11 [<hi rendition="#italic">10</hi>], 6
                    p.m. Authorization granted. Governors being informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
